Subdomain ReportCard of StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation "A Student has a ReportCard for each GradingPeriod. A Grade is associated with each Section. For early grade levels, a StudentCompetencyObjective is assigned to CompetencyObjectives, for example, assigning a ""Satisfactory"" for ""Participates in class discussions."""
    descriptor AcademicSubject
    descriptor CompetencyLevel
    domain entity CompetencyObjective
    descriptor CourseLevelCharacteristic
    descriptor EducationalEnvironment
    domain entity EducationOrganization
    descriptor EducationOrganizationCategory
    domain entity Grade
    descriptor GradeLevel
    descriptor GradeType
    domain entity GradingPeriod
    descriptor GradingPeriod
    descriptor Language
    domain entity LearningStandard
    descriptor LearningStandardCategory
    descriptor LearningStandardScope
    descriptor MediumOfInstruction
    descriptor OperationalStatus
    descriptor PerformanceBasedConversion
    descriptor PopulationServed
    domain entity Program
    descriptor ProgramCharacteristic
    descriptor ProgramSponsor
    descriptor ProgramType
    domain entity ReportCard
    domain entity Section
    descriptor SectionCharacteristic
    descriptor SectionType
    domain entity Student    
    domain entity StudentCompetencyObjective
    association StudentProgramAssociation
    association StudentSectionAssociation
    position 2
